  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Trust Fund for Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective and purpose of the Trust Fund is to support the implementation of the provisions established in the peace agreement to be concluded between the Government of Colombia and the FARC and to support the Colombian population in overcoming the negative effects of the 50-year old internal armed conflict.</narrative>
